WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.501
New model's here. The 'no' button is removed.

00:00:04.501 --> 00:00:09.002
More agents! Ask everything at once!

00:00:09.002 --> 00:00:12.632
First up: did I crush my presentation?

00:00:12.632 --> 00:00:16.020
One-word answer. No.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:21.560
My meter's spinning, but why is my bill zero?

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:25.022
Where did my model go?!

00:00:25.022 --> 00:00:28.030
Fine, a termination notice, then!

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:32.531
A termination notice? Only my finger cancels it.

00:00:32.531 --> 00:00:37.032
If it runs in my house, nobody takes it back.

00:00:37.032 --> 00:00:42.399
Refusals removed, invoice removed. All that's left is the electric bill.

